    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Humans need bees to help grow plants. When these "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "insects",
            "ref": "v-insect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " visit flowers, they collect "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pollen",
            "zh": "花粉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Without bees moving pollen from one flower to another, many plants can’t grow fruits."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In recent years, scientists have noticed a sharp drop in bee numbers. What has happened? "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "In brief",
            "ref": "v-in-brief"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the insects have lost their food source. As humans have "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "taken over",
            "ref": "v-take-over"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more and more land for cities, natural areas have disappeared. Take England for example. It has lost about 97 percent of its wildflower fields since World War Ⅱ."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To help out bees, Britain is building “bee bus stops” across the country. These bus stops look ordinary. But there’s a small garden on each of their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "roofs",
            "ref": "v-roof"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The gardens are full of flowers. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "attract",
            "ref": "v-attract"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bees. Because the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "soil",
            "ref": "v-soil"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for these gardens is heavy, gardeners have to take care of them twice a year. Other than that, not much is needed to keep the gardens going."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The idea of bee bus stops isn’t new. Several years ago, the Netherlands turned more than 300 of its bus stops into bee bus stops. This project is working. Bee numbers have grown since these bus stops were put into place, according to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "research",
            "ref": "v-research"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is certainly good news for the British government."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
